  "usageAccessDisclosure": "To show screen time, Mongez reads your phone's usage data from Android: the apps you open, how long each app is used, how long the screen is on, and how many times you unlock it.\n\nThis data is read only while you have the app open (never in the background), is shown to you on the \"Screen time\" tab, and stays on your device: it is not sent, sold or shared with anyone. The app doesn't connect to the internet at all.\n\nYou can revoke the permission at any time in your phone's settings.",
  "privacySummaryTitle": "Summary",
  "privacySummaryBody": "Mongez works entirely on your phone. There is no account, no ads, and no tracking or analytics tools, and the app doesn't have permission to connect to the internet. We don't collect or receive any data about you.",
  "privacyStoredTitle": "Data stored on your device",
  "privacyStoredBody": "Your tasks and their notes, your completion history, your goals, app settings, the list of apps you chose to track with their daily limits, and the background photo if you picked one. All of it is kept in the app's private storage on your phone only.",
  "privacyUsageTitle": "Phone usage data (Screen time)",
  "privacyUsageIntro": "This feature is optional and only works if you grant the app \"Usage access\" yourself in your phone's settings.",
  "privacyPermissionsTitle": "Other permissions",
  "privacyPermissionsBody": "• Notifications, alarms & reminders: to show task reminders on time.\n• Run at startup: to reschedule reminders after the phone restarts.\n• Vibrate: with reminders.\n• Photos: the app doesn't request photo access; when you pick a background, the system photo picker opens and the app receives only the photo you choose.",
  "privacyBackupTitle": "Backups",
  "privacyBackupBody": "When you export a backup, a file is created where you choose, and you control it. Android may include the app's data in your Google account's backup if that is turned on on your phone; that is governed by your phone's settings and Google's policy.",
  "privacyDeleteTitle": "Deleting your data",
  "privacyDeleteBody": "You can delete tasks and history inside the app. To delete everything, clear the app's data in your phone's settings or uninstall the app.",
  "privacyChildrenTitle": "Children",
  "privacyChildrenBody": "The app is a general organizing tool, isn't directed at children, and collects no data from any user.",
  "privacyChangesTitle": "Changes and contact",
  "privacyChangesBody": "Any change to this policy is published with an app update and on the project page. The app is open source; for questions, you can open an issue on the project's GitHub page.\n\nLast updated: November 10, 2026",
  "privacyWebVersion": "Web version (English / عربي)"
}
